        >
        ["nl"] = <
            language = <[ISO_639-1::nl]>
            purpose = <"Generiek containerarchetype om informatie over te dragen die met anderen moet worden gedeeld.">
            keywords = <"rapportage", ...>
            use = <"*Use as a generic archetype to carry information about the result of a stand-alone test or assessment, or a group of related results.

It is anticipated that each COMPOSITION.report-result archetype will contain at least one OBSERVATION archetype that will hold the test results, but depending on the complexity of the test or assessment other archetypes may also be included to provide the complete clinical context.

Common use cases are: 
- one or more specimen-related pathology/laboratory test results; 
- one or more time-related imaging examination test results;
- an ECG result; or 
- an audiogram hearing assessment.

The main Sections/Content component has been deliberately left unconstrained. This will allow it to be populated with any SECTION or ENTRY archetypes appropriate for the clinical purpose within a template. (en)">
            misuse = <"">
        >
        ["ca"] = <
            language = <[ISO_639-1::ca]>
            purpose = <"Arquetip contenidor genèric per transmetre informació sobre el resultat d'una prova o avaluació.">
            keywords = <"informe", "prova", "resultat", "diagnòstic">
            use = <"*Use as a generic archetype to carry information about the result of a stand-alone test or assessment, or a group of related results.

It is anticipated that each COMPOSITION.report-result archetype will contain at least one OBSERVATION archetype that will hold the test results, but depending on the complexity of the test or assessment other archetypes may also be included to provide the complete clinical context.

Common use cases are: 
- one or more specimen-related pathology/laboratory test results; 
- one or more time-related imaging examination test results;
- an ECG result; or 
- an audiogram hearing assessment.

The main Sections/Content component has been deliberately left unconstrained. This will allow it to be populated with any SECTION or ENTRY archetypes appropriate for the clinical purpose within a template. (en)">
            misuse = <"No s'ha d'utilitzar per a informes que no estiguin relacionats amb els resultats d'una prova o avaluació. Utilitzar el COMPOSITION.report genèric o COMPOSITIONs amb fins específics, segons escaigui.

No s'ha d'utilitzar per als resultats de proves o avaluacions que es registren com a part d'una nota de consulta, per exemple, l'escala de coma de Glasgow en el context d'una consulta d'urgències - utilitzeu l'arquetip OBSERVATION.glasgow_coma_scale com a component dins de COMPOSITION.encouter.">
        >
    >

definition
    COMPOSITION[at0000.1] matches {    -- Result report
        /context[at9002]/other_context[at0001]/items matches {
            ELEMENT[at0005] occurrences matches {0..1}
        }
    }

